        "description": "<p>GlotPress plugin to restrict subscribers from suggesting translations.</p>\n<p>In case a subscriber has extra permissions, being a validator for a specific locale,<br />\nthey will be able to add translations to that locale, but not to others.</p>\n<h4>Configuration</h4>\n<p>Once you have installed GP Restrict Subscribers Suggest it is ready to use.</p>\n",
